<title>USA: ABC Rail to buy American Systems Tech.</title>
<headline>ABC Rail to buy American Systems Tech.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Rail Products Corp said Wednesday it agreed in principle to acquire American Systems Technologies Inc, a Verona, Wis.-based company that installs and maintains railway signal systems.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close by yearend.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
